WEBVTT

00:15.870 --> 00:16.080
<b>Honki</b>

00:21.550 --> 00:22.300
Marito-kun!

00:22.300 --> 00:23.880
Marito-kun? Marito-kun?

00:25.100 --> 00:26.340
<i>That was...</i>

00:27.010 --> 00:28.000
<i>just like...</i>

00:29.870 --> 00:31.640
<i>a Honki Person!</i>

00:33.010 --> 00:34.640
Huh? What?

00:34.640 --> 00:35.440
Whaddya mean?

00:35.440 --> 00:38.890
Hey! What's this crap 
about losing your virginity?!

00:38.890 --> 00:41.380
You told me to tell you my wish!

00:41.380 --> 00:44.520
For stuff like this, you're supposed 
to say you wanna get stronger!

00:44.520 --> 00:45.700
Big Brother?

00:45.700 --> 00:46.850
Marito?

00:53.370 --> 00:56.290
How exciting!

01:03.540 --> 01:04.750
Ara-chan!

01:05.220 --> 01:06.500
Are you okay, Ryu-chan?

01:06.990 --> 01:08.790
Matakara...

01:11.720 --> 01:12.860
It's the cops!

01:12.860 --> 01:13.850
Let's split!

01:15.920 --> 01:17.140
Marito?

01:17.810 --> 01:19.480
My mind's made up!

01:19.480 --> 01:23.980
I'm gonna get Ara-teen into Siguma!

03:01.920 --> 03:03.860
Ara-chan! You okay?

03:04.660 --> 03:06.330
Matakara?

03:06.370 --> 03:11.900
<b>#02 Wanna Take You On! The Chu Chu Chinese Pepper Steak Train!</b>

03:06.650 --> 03:09.190
Ouch! Ow...

03:11.020 --> 03:12.210
Don't you remember?

03:12.620 --> 03:16.220
You landed a punch on 
Marito-kun. It was amazing!

03:16.550 --> 03:17.770
Marito?

03:18.840 --> 03:19.930
What about Mahoro-chan?!

03:19.930 --> 03:22.850
Uh... She probably went home.

03:25.840 --> 03:29.430
I guess beating her brother was a bad idea.

03:29.810 --> 03:31.070
What?

03:31.070 --> 03:32.130
What?

03:32.570 --> 03:37.050
Damn it. Why do I have to run 
errands for that little punk?

03:37.780 --> 03:39.990
<b>Aahar Bath</b>

03:40.930 --> 03:42.660
You're from Siguma!

03:43.580 --> 03:45.190
Hey! Wait!

03:46.400 --> 03:47.760
Is this...

03:47.760 --> 03:52.720
Yeah. I'm still living at the 
bathhouse my relatives run.

03:54.330 --> 03:56.170
Oh. Remember this?

03:56.600 --> 03:59.210
The best friend stone you 
gave me a long time ago.

04:00.110 --> 04:02.930
You said that when I held this, 
it'd make me stronger.

04:02.930 --> 04:05.390
<b>Ma</b>

04:02.930 --> 04:05.390
<b>Jin</b>

04:02.930 --> 04:05.390
<b>Ara</b>

04:02.930 --> 04:05.390
<b>Takara</b>

04:05.390 --> 04:08.640
I doubt you still have yours, though.

04:08.640 --> 04:10.870
I'm going.

04:17.650 --> 04:18.860
Ara-chan!

04:21.050 --> 04:25.370
Did you start avoiding me 
because I wasn't strong enough?

04:26.820 --> 04:29.620
That was so long ago I don't even remember.

04:36.470 --> 04:37.460
Hey.

04:38.460 --> 04:41.840
Let's take that guy on! Yeah?

04:41.840 --> 04:44.510
Shut up! Not a chance!

04:44.510 --> 04:46.350
Don't worry, don't worry.

04:46.350 --> 04:50.100
Although you lost today, you'll win tomorrow!

04:50.100 --> 04:51.100
Huh?

04:51.540 --> 04:52.720
I won today.

04:52.720 --> 04:53.830
Nah, you lost.

04:53.830 --> 04:54.890
Huh?!

04:54.890 --> 04:56.940
That was Minato and Siguma, right?

04:56.940 --> 04:58.610
Yeah, they fight like that all the time.

05:04.480 --> 05:06.510
Hey, don't yank that!

05:08.040 --> 05:10.500
They'll see it! People will see it!

05:10.500 --> 05:12.760
Welcome in!

05:12.760 --> 05:14.780
Which girl would you prefer today?

05:14.780 --> 05:16.860
Well...

05:18.930 --> 05:20.320
I'll take Jasmine-chan.

05:20.320 --> 05:23.010
All right! A guest for Jasmine-chan!

05:23.720 --> 05:27.520
I came back. I just can't 
get you out of my head!

05:27.520 --> 05:31.520
Ah! I simply can't take it 
when you cling to me like that!

05:31.520 --> 05:33.870
Heave-ho, here we go!

05:33.870 --> 05:35.900
Staahp! I'm bwegging you!

05:39.690 --> 05:41.440
We were too late.

05:41.440 --> 05:42.840
Ow...

05:43.840 --> 05:45.740
Hey! Why the hell are you here?

05:45.740 --> 05:48.240
You look good as new, damn it!

05:48.660 --> 05:50.000
You called?

05:56.000 --> 05:58.000
<b>Chu Chu Chinese Restaurant</b>

05:58.000 --> 05:59.780
Ouch!

06:00.400 --> 06:03.010
Today destroyed me.

06:04.010 --> 06:08.620
<i>But in that one second, I felt 
all this power running through me.</i>

06:08.620 --> 06:10.600
<i>It was like I was someone else.</i>

06:14.110 --> 06:16.630
What the hell are you, anyway?

06:16.630 --> 06:18.110
I told you...

06:19.170 --> 06:22.750
My name is Senya! I am a true Honki Person!

06:22.750 --> 06:25.340
Or at least the closest a man can get!

06:25.340 --> 06:26.860
So you aren't one.

06:26.860 --> 06:29.870
Anyway, isn't that Honki 
People stuff just a legend?

06:29.870 --> 06:32.910
Once you and I merged,
 you threw a massive punch, right?

06:32.910 --> 06:36.970
But you could only manage one 
because we were only partially merged.

06:39.920 --> 06:41.390
Partially merged?

06:41.860 --> 06:46.260
Yeah. You won't get stronger unless 
we're truly one in body and soul.

06:46.550 --> 06:50.010
Body and soul? With you?

06:50.840 --> 06:52.140
With me.

06:52.140 --> 06:53.770
Become one?

06:54.160 --> 06:55.600
Joined at the hip.

06:56.270 --> 06:57.940
Barf!

06:57.940 --> 07:00.470
Why the hell do you wanna 
merge with me, anyway?

07:00.470 --> 07:03.030
W-Well, you know...

07:03.650 --> 07:07.740
It's something that happens to men, right? 
You want to merge so, so badly

07:08.000 --> 07:10.530
that you can't even sleep at night.

07:12.040 --> 07:14.250
Oh, yeah. That happens.

07:14.250 --> 07:15.860
Did you sneak a kiss on your date?

07:15.860 --> 07:17.750
Don't just barge in, you old hag!

07:19.070 --> 07:21.090
Doesn't it hurt, Big Brother?

07:21.090 --> 07:23.760
I told ya not to come here.

07:24.170 --> 07:28.090
But I'm just so worried about you!

07:29.730 --> 07:30.440
Stop!

07:30.440 --> 07:31.390
Hey, you!

07:31.390 --> 07:32.790
'Scuse us!

07:34.010 --> 07:36.600
I'm Jabashiri. Can we talk?

07:36.600 --> 07:37.130
Tsk.

07:37.130 --> 07:39.750
You're way out of your league here, first-year.

07:39.750 --> 07:43.070
Outa, it's okay. Want some Maji Kebab?

07:43.070 --> 07:44.320
Thanks much.

07:45.440 --> 07:48.850
Yesterday, Tat followed 
Matakara from Minato.

07:49.430 --> 07:52.450
He took that guy Tomoshibi 
Arajin to his place.

07:52.450 --> 07:54.200
Huh.

07:54.670 --> 07:57.460
Are you going to recruit 
a guy who's in with Minato?

07:57.460 --> 08:03.490
Then maybe I'll just recruit Matakara, too. 
He does seem pretty tough.

08:07.820 --> 08:09.330
What a neat sound!

08:09.330 --> 08:10.970
Ryu-chan, are you okay?

08:12.110 --> 08:15.310
I'm the one who's gonna be 
your successor, Marito-kun.

08:19.520 --> 08:21.270
That's Tomoshibi Arajin.

08:21.270 --> 08:23.480
That shrimp took Jin Marito?

08:23.480 --> 08:25.030
I could take him on.

08:25.030 --> 08:26.460
No, me first!

08:26.460 --> 08:27.670
You're so popular!

08:27.670 --> 08:30.100
Why would I want to be popular with guys?!

08:30.100 --> 08:31.840
That guy made eye contact!

08:31.840 --> 08:33.570
Let's get 'em! Let's take 'em out!

08:33.570 --> 08:34.540
Shut up!

08:35.800 --> 08:37.540
No, not you...

08:37.540 --> 08:40.700
Ara-teen!

08:40.700 --> 08:42.670
Big... Brother?

08:44.420 --> 08:46.420
<b>Minato Kai</b>

08:46.420 --> 08:47.940
Excuse me.

08:50.850 --> 08:51.930
Matakara.

08:52.380 --> 08:55.190
I really don't think you should 
hang with that little punk.

08:55.570 --> 08:58.060
He's got a nasty monkey 
or something on his back.

08:58.060 --> 09:01.710
Come on, don't say it like that. 
What do you even mean?

09:01.710 --> 09:04.190
Zabu can see things, you know.

09:05.790 --> 09:10.090
I'm actually thinking of asking 
Ara-chan to join Minato Kai.

09:10.090 --> 09:13.980
What?! That punk? There's no way 
Ken-san would allow that!

09:13.980 --> 09:16.490
Ken-san himself wants to meet him.

09:16.490 --> 09:17.580
Ken-san does?!

09:17.580 --> 09:19.080
<b>Mi</b>

09:20.480 --> 09:24.460
I don't get it. What do you see in that jerk?

09:25.460 --> 09:29.880
Ara-chan's fist was just like 
a real Honki Person's!

09:30.340 --> 09:34.970
Oh, come on. Why are you taking 
that old story seriously?

09:35.280 --> 09:37.310
It's just a fairy tale.

09:40.870 --> 09:44.610
Matakara! You know what 
class Ara-teen is in?

09:45.810 --> 09:47.860
Do you have business with Ara-chan?

09:48.270 --> 09:50.270
I'm going to recruit him for Siguma.

09:55.370 --> 10:01.420
And, well, he hadn't lost even once. 
His famous fight with Sasaki Kojiro

10:01.420 --> 10:04.700
became the subject of many works 
of popular entertainment.

10:02.040 --> 10:04.700
I wanted to take you on!

10:04.700 --> 10:06.170
Musashi!

10:06.170 --> 10:07.670
Shut the hell up!

10:08.560 --> 10:11.040
Uh, never mind.

10:13.240 --> 10:15.640
Okay, next page...

10:18.520 --> 10:20.690
You still have a crush on that girl?

10:20.690 --> 10:22.690
Even though she got her 
brother to beat you up?

10:22.690 --> 10:26.710
You're wrong! He was just testing 
his darling sister's boyfriend—

10:26.710 --> 10:28.440
But you just took off when he showed up.

10:28.440 --> 10:30.710
M-My legs just moved on their own.

10:30.710 --> 10:32.820
Ara-teen!

10:36.070 --> 10:38.630
Hm? Whawhat?

10:39.940 --> 10:42.730
I wish I could be with you 
all the time, Big Brother.

10:42.730 --> 10:45.290
Instead of that creepy rock guy.

10:45.810 --> 10:47.460
Are you even listening, Brother?

10:47.940 --> 10:49.210
Jeez.

10:49.210 --> 10:50.460
Mahoro-chan!

10:52.710 --> 10:57.470
What a coincidence. I was only passing by 
and had no idea you'd be here!

11:03.740 --> 11:06.230
Smooch! It's Chu Chu Chinese Pepper Steak!

11:06.740 --> 11:07.940
Old hag.

11:09.250 --> 11:13.490
I'm really sorry about yesterday. 
After you even introduced me to your brother...

11:14.070 --> 11:18.280
I want to face off with him one 
more time to earn his respect.

11:18.280 --> 11:18.990
So I—

11:18.990 --> 11:21.990
If you hurt my brother again, I'll kill you.

11:24.830 --> 11:26.070
You can have this back.

11:26.500 --> 11:30.420
Um, but that's a love forever stone, so...

11:35.500 --> 11:39.300
Aw, I guess the stone got all broken!

11:40.910 --> 11:43.330
Big Brother, let's walk home together.

11:48.820 --> 11:51.820
C'mere. Now.

11:56.420 --> 11:59.260
Big Brother, I...

12:01.600 --> 12:05.370
You feel it? Did you feel my love,

12:05.690 --> 12:08.050
Ara-teen?

12:10.080 --> 12:12.130
Ara-teen is dead meat.

12:12.620 --> 12:15.800
Love... for... ever.

12:16.390 --> 12:19.850
Love... for... ever.

12:20.390 --> 12:24.230
Hey. Pull yourself together, man.

12:24.230 --> 12:27.910
Love... for... ever.

12:29.700 --> 12:32.520
<i>Dear Brother, have you been well?</i>

12:33.150 --> 12:35.650
<i>Something wonderful happened to me recently.</i>

12:36.150 --> 12:38.980
<i>Ara-chan transferred into Ichizu High!</i>

12:40.580 --> 12:45.160
<i>I want to start training again with 
Ara-chan to become Honki People.</i>

12:45.740 --> 12:48.660
<i>There's only one month left 
until you come home.</i>

12:48.660 --> 12:50.580
<i>I'm really looking forward to that.</i>

12:51.030 --> 12:52.290
<i>From Matakara.</i>

12:52.920 --> 12:54.160
There.

12:52.920 --> 12:54.170
<b>From
Matakara</b>

13:13.810 --> 13:16.830
Yukimura! I really wish...

13:17.510 --> 13:20.440
I could've taken you on!

13:22.690 --> 13:25.200
Ara-chan. I have something to say.

13:25.780 --> 13:29.330
I want you to join Minato Kai.

13:29.770 --> 13:33.580
I saw you send Marito-kun flying 
with one punch, and it—

13:33.580 --> 13:34.890
Coming through.

13:35.340 --> 13:36.710
Jabashiri!

13:37.340 --> 13:40.120
What are you Siguma playboys doing here?

13:40.590 --> 13:42.800
Hey, you're the guy from yesterday!

13:45.640 --> 13:46.470
Zabu!

13:46.470 --> 13:48.490
<i>What, what? What is happening?</i>

13:48.490 --> 13:50.730
<i>Blow away! Blow away, storm!</i>

13:51.850 --> 13:53.190
What do you think you're doing?

13:53.190 --> 13:57.070
Outta the way, Matakara. 
I've got business with the shrimp over there.

13:57.070 --> 13:59.070
<i>The storm's right on top of me!</i>

13:59.380 --> 14:00.540
With Ara-chan?

14:01.020 --> 14:03.550
Well, you might have to take up 
that "business" with me instead.

14:03.820 --> 14:07.700
Fine by me. I've been 
waiting to slaughter you.

14:07.700 --> 14:09.110
Step outside.

14:12.500 --> 14:14.000
<i>Safe!</i>

14:14.540 --> 14:18.360
Tomoshibi! I'm gonna take my time 
with you when I get back!

14:18.800 --> 14:20.800
<i>No!</i>

14:30.930 --> 14:33.560
You idiot! What about the fight?!

14:33.560 --> 14:36.560
No way! I can't get mixed up in that!

14:37.460 --> 14:38.690
Let's go, let's go!

14:41.230 --> 14:43.190
And you call yourself a man?!

14:43.510 --> 14:45.640
You're gonna run and 
leave your friend behind?

14:51.010 --> 14:53.460
M-My guts...

14:53.460 --> 14:55.460
are gonna blow!

15:04.170 --> 15:06.130
<i>What flexibility!</i>

15:07.730 --> 15:09.510
<i>Let's see how you like this!</i>

15:45.050 --> 15:46.420
<i>I got one in!</i>

15:48.320 --> 15:50.370
Now I've got you!

15:59.640 --> 16:02.020
Die!

16:10.850 --> 16:14.490
S-Stop! I said quit yanking it!

16:23.040 --> 16:24.800
Yes!

16:25.670 --> 16:26.920
Are you okay?

16:26.920 --> 16:31.770
All because you had to start 
dribbling shit everywhere! Damn it!

16:33.890 --> 16:35.770
Matakara?

16:43.650 --> 16:45.140
Ow!

16:46.180 --> 16:49.780
The guy's head is a rock. 
Still feels like I'm spinning.

16:53.300 --> 16:55.790
You're not half bad.

16:59.360 --> 17:02.780
It's nothing compared to you 
landing that punch on Marito-kun.

17:06.100 --> 17:07.720
All right, I'm going.

17:11.090 --> 17:13.800
Ara-chan! Join Minato Kai!

17:14.140 --> 17:16.900
I've gotten stronger.

17:17.460 --> 17:21.770
I think we really have a shot at 
becoming Honki People together now!

17:24.410 --> 17:27.990
<i>These guys were training 
to become Honki People?</i>

17:29.010 --> 17:31.290
I told you I'm done with that.

17:32.750 --> 17:35.900
Come and meet our head, Ken-san.

17:35.900 --> 17:38.410
He's totally strong and 
a really respectable guy!

17:38.850 --> 17:41.130
He's fighting with Marito-kun for the top.

17:42.550 --> 17:46.060
With her brother? For the top?

17:46.630 --> 17:49.130
<b>Mi</b>

17:50.890 --> 17:54.050
So you were training to 
become a Honki Person!

17:54.050 --> 17:57.510
A real man should dream 
of taking the top, after all!

17:57.510 --> 18:05.230
<b>Sincerity</b>

17:57.510 --> 18:05.230
<b>Truth</b>

17:57.510 --> 18:05.230
<b>Calm</b>

17:57.510 --> 18:05.230
<b>Spirit</b>

17:57.510 --> 18:05.230
<b>Ocean</b>

17:59.470 --> 18:01.380
So how old is Ken-san?

18:01.380 --> 18:04.030
Well, he was held back three times, so...

18:04.640 --> 18:06.900
Wait, he's 21?!

18:08.320 --> 18:09.720
So he's an...

18:11.400 --> 18:12.790
old man?!

18:17.220 --> 18:19.240
He so stronk!

18:19.690 --> 18:22.640
Ken-san, this is Tomoshibi Arajin.

18:22.640 --> 18:24.060
With Ara-chan in Minato, I'm sure—

18:24.060 --> 18:25.300
So, hey.

18:26.150 --> 18:28.840
I wanna go one round. With you.

18:28.840 --> 18:30.420
What?! Ara-chan?!

18:30.890 --> 18:35.340
Well said! Go for the top, man! Bucchigiri!

18:35.340 --> 18:38.480
<i>If I can beat an old guy who's on the 
same level as Mahoro-chan's brother,</i>

18:38.480 --> 18:42.560
<i>I won't have to hurt her brother 
to show her how strong I am!</i>

18:42.820 --> 18:45.310
<i>I'm, like, brilliant!</i>

18:49.320 --> 18:53.060
He's taking Ken-san on? 
Does he have a death wish?

18:53.060 --> 18:54.950
Please wait, Ken-san!

18:56.500 --> 18:58.660
<i>Ara-chan, why?</i>

18:59.090 --> 19:00.550
Let's do this, Senya.

19:01.040 --> 19:04.620
So you've finally discovered your true wish!

19:04.620 --> 19:07.340
Yeah. My wish is...

19:09.400 --> 19:14.240
to lose my virginity!

19:14.240 --> 19:16.970
Bucchigiri!

19:31.770 --> 19:32.760
Ken-san?!

19:32.760 --> 19:33.850
Ken-san!

19:33.850 --> 19:35.280
Incredible...

19:36.570 --> 19:38.550
<i>Ara-chan really is the one!</i>

19:39.280 --> 19:40.490
Done and done.

19:40.490 --> 19:42.910
Is that the only thing in your head?!

19:42.910 --> 19:46.290
Nothing's more important 
than losing my virginity!

19:46.290 --> 19:48.250
Sure there is! Like getting stronger!

19:48.250 --> 19:50.790
Or getting stronger! 
Or even getting stronger!

19:50.790 --> 19:55.130
Your mind is stuck on that one thing?! 
What?! You're one to talk!

19:55.460 --> 19:58.870
And you're supposed to be my 
imaginary friend, you muscleheaded—

19:58.870 --> 19:59.890
Huh?

20:05.410 --> 20:06.530
Ara-chan?

20:08.850 --> 20:10.860
<b>Spirit</b>

20:12.860 --> 20:14.140
Matakara!

20:14.140 --> 20:16.230
What the hell have you done?

20:17.000 --> 20:18.370
I'm sorry.

20:22.930 --> 20:24.270
He's raging!

20:24.270 --> 20:26.450
No. He's laughing!

20:31.710 --> 20:34.340
<b>I'M</b>

20:34.340 --> 20:35.960
<b>IN 

LOVE</b>

20:37.300 --> 20:38.840
What?!

20:43.940 --> 20:45.910
It still hurts.

20:45.910 --> 20:49.420
Hey! Let's go another round with that guy!

20:49.420 --> 20:50.780
I ain't going anywhere!

20:52.600 --> 20:54.980
But I guess I won again.

20:54.980 --> 20:57.570
It's like I've got no limits.

20:57.570 --> 20:58.160
Huh?

20:58.160 --> 20:58.990
Huh?

20:58.990 --> 21:00.280
You lost, though.

21:00.280 --> 21:01.700
What? Seriously?

21:01.700 --> 21:02.540
Seriously.

21:02.540 --> 21:05.330
Ara-teen!

21:10.050 --> 21:10.990
Eh?

21:11.790 --> 21:12.830
Bam!

21:14.160 --> 21:16.590
I finally caught you!

21:17.070 --> 21:20.870
That punch of yours, Ara-teen... 
I just can't forget it.

21:21.170 --> 21:22.680
Join our team.

21:22.990 --> 21:24.110
Yes, but...

21:24.110 --> 21:27.370
If I enter your esteemed organization, 
I'm certain I would only be a burden.

21:27.370 --> 21:28.930
I mean, like, get real.

21:28.930 --> 21:31.130
May I use this occasion 
to respectfully decline—

21:34.080 --> 21:35.460
Please...

21:35.460 --> 21:37.050
join us...

21:37.050 --> 21:37.980
heart?

21:41.740 --> 21:42.910
Dear brother!

21:43.310 --> 21:45.050
I will join Siguma!

21:45.050 --> 21:46.620
Yahooey!

21:46.940 --> 21:50.330
Ara-chan! Ken-san wants you to join Minato...

21:50.330 --> 21:51.570
Kai...

21:52.940 --> 21:54.430
Matakara...

21:54.430 --> 21:58.070
Too bad! You missed your chance.

21:58.070 --> 22:00.550
Ara-teen is mine now.

